.TH DRAWIO 1 "August 2026" "draw.io Desktop 31.3.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
drawio \- edit and export diagrams with draw.io Desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B drawio
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ file ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B drawio
starts draw.io Desktop using the distribution-managed, versioned Electron 42
runtime. Application updates are supplied through APT; the upstream in-app
updater is disabled.
.SH OPTIONS
The graphical application accepts files and URLs. Its command-line export
interface includes
.BR --export ,
.BR --format ,
and
.BR --output .
Run
.B drawio --help
for the options supported by this release.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/drawio-desktop/resources/app.asar
Application payload.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/electron-runtime-42/electron
Shared Electron executable.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR electron (1)
